*Key Formulae:*
- *Green's Theorem:*
  $ integral.cont_C P d x + Q d y = integral.double_D ( (partial Q) / (partial x) - (partial P) / (partial y) ) d A $
  where $C$ is a positively oriented, piecewise-smooth, simple closed curve bounding the region $D$.
